  <dmn:decision id="_91212041-F13C-4C12-B37C-F34D47AB3994" name="checks">
    <dmn:description>Composes Pennsylvania residence, income at/below 150% FPL using pa-liheap and the liheap schedule, an eligible household member, verified heating arrangement, primary heating-cost responsibility and no ordinary Cash receipt in the federal program year. Cash and Crisis share the same prepared assessment. Prepare countable income and eligible-member size under Appendix B §§601.41, 601.81–84, including required income of ineligible members and exclusions. Allowed applicant lookback is the preceding calendar month annualized or preceding 12 months; DHS income on file has a separate annualization rule. Do not substitute a rolling 30 days for the preceding month. Cash requires neither arrears nor another public benefit. The advertised season is 2026-11-02 through 2027-04-23; opening dates are separate from household eligibility. The detailed final plan was used because the handbook host was unavailable. Household screening only: application windows, available funds, waitlists and provider scheduling do not change checks/isEligible. No award, account establishment or work approval is calculated. Policy review preserved from 2026-10-15. Named entries invoke reusable check Decision Services; inspect those models for their policy interpretation and input contract.</dmn:description>
    <dmn:extensionElements>
      <kie:attachment name="Pennsylvania DHS LIHEAP — program overview" url="https://www.pa.gov/agencies/dhs/resources/liheap" />
      <kie:attachment name="FY2027 LIHEAP final state plan — Appendix B, §§601.31, 601.41, 601.81–84" url="https://www.pa.gov/content/dam/copapwp-pagov/en/dhs/documents/services/assistance/documents/heating-assistance_liheap/2027-liheap-state-plan.pdf" />
      <kie:attachment name="LIHEAP policy handbook — unavailable during 2026-10-15 review; final plan used" url="http://services.dpw.state.pa.us/oimpolicymanuals/liheap/index.htm" />
    </dmn:extensionElements>
